							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Shows you what u know shrek. You don even play anymore and yeah so what used Mq the first couple times to save time. Still have to kill the Mshas, never once did MQ kill a single boss mob EVER. And for not wanting us to kill them, screw taking a 40some person raid to kill a mob thats one grpable and taking 3hrs to kill it when it can be done in an hr. And for your info since they changed how u zone into qvic we havent had to skip trash. And yeah over 60% of your alliance members use MQ and other progams but thats besides the pt cause like i said MQ has never ever killed a mob for anyone. And yes i been a full member, again spouting what u dont know. When did i take credit for killing a mob ???? Just was point out the fact that over 30% of the folks on the kill were from RN that u guys talked shit about and were too good to be associated with. And one more thing, no offense to any in EIE atm but thats the reason the alliance struggled so long. Why would you not let your members get gear on thier own, instead of having them sit in ele armor. Why hold people back?
						</td>
