								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Thats like me asking you why you had to do it secretly behind our backs instead of inviting people to go.&nbsp; When the fuck did we EVER say NOT to kill something on your own?&nbsp; I&#039;ll tell you when - NEVER.&nbsp; The only stipulation was for you to make sure you invited alliance people to go.&nbsp; &nbsp;Lets call this what it is, you wanted freebies for yourself and your small group, not to gear the alliance.<br /><br />Don&#039;t even try to pin that shit on us.&nbsp; You wanted to do whatever the fuck you wanted, hey you never heard me bitch about it.&nbsp; But don&#039;t 180 and come here posting like you had &quot;team&quot; on your mind.<br /><br />And I&#039;ll tell you why your 30% group of lost boys was not wanted.&nbsp; Not because they couldn&#039;t function on a raid, its mostly because they had irritating personalities no one wanted to be around.&nbsp; &nbsp;If you had a problem with that I seriously question wtf you joined EiE for in the first place.<br /><br />edit:&nbsp; Oh and one more thing.&nbsp; The alliance didn&#039;t stall till EQ2 and WoW came out , just like everybody else.&nbsp; That&#039;s called player attrition, not undergeared players.
						</td>
					</tr>
