								The World&#039;s on Heroin<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<a href="aim:goim?screenname=PervertedlySlow&amp;message=Hi.+Are+you+there?"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/aim.gif" alt="PervertedlySlow" border="0" /></a><br />
