						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16527#msg16527"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16527#msg16527">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2727 on:</b> April 18, 2005, 12:44:18 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Alliance never stopped anyone from forming up a Qvic mini raid during offtimes.&nbsp; We just asked that all members of the alliance were invited and anyone that looted a mold payed dkp.&nbsp; <br /><br />
						</td>
